mint-finder (1.0.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Search programs, files, and folders from a shortcut.
  * Group preferences and keep the shortcut hint next to the shortcut.
  * State that this project is independent of Linux Mint.
  * Leave the compiled settings cache out of the source package.
  * Leave blacklisted folders, and everything inside them, out of search.
  * Blacklist a folder from its result, and show matches from each search folder.
  * Move a folder between bookmarks and the blacklist.
  * Divide preferences into General, Bookmarks, and Blacklist pages.
  * Keep Add and Remove the same size on every preferences page.

